## Design system

Tokens are in `web/packages/tokens/src` (W3C design tokens, compiled by Style Dictionary{{ if object.has_key project "frontend.color-scheme" }}; the dark theme's colours in `web/packages/tokens/dark`{{ end }}); the design system's components, each with a story, are in `web/packages/ui`. Browse them in Storybook:

```bash
cd web && pnpm --filter @{{ name }}/ui storybook
```